    "fetched_at": "2026-04-22T02:00:36+00:00",
    "text": "## Description\n\nThis dataset is a obtained from AI4SmallFarms dataset publised by the University of Twente Research Information. It is updated by the requiremnt of the fieldscapes project.\n\nThe large-scale data set consists of 120,913 field polygons divided into 30 tiles of approximately 5\u00d75 km distributed across Vietnam, covering a range of fields and diverse landscape types. The field polygons have been meticulously digitized by original author from satellite images, following a rigorous multi-step quality control process and topological consistency checks.\n\n_The field boundaries are valid for the year August 2021_\n\n- **Original Data Provider:** [DATA Archiving and Networked Services (DANS)](https://research.tudelft.nl/en/publications/ai4smallfarms-a-dataset-for-crop-field-delineation-in-southeast-a)\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\n- **License:** CC-BY-4.0\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\n\n---\n\n## Columns\n\n| Property               | Data Type |\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\n| id                     | string    |\n| determination_datetime | datetime  |\n| area                   | float     |\n| \\_predicate            | string    |\n"
  },
